              "args": {
                "content": "LANDSCAPE OVERVIEW (11 systems):\n- corp.itsm: IT Service Management (incident analysis, asset provisioning, change automation, safety)\n- emarsys.cx: Customer Experience/Marketing (campaign optimization, opportunity engagement)\n- my.mes: Manufacturing Execution (quality monitoring, production coordination)\n- sap.ariba: Procurement (vendor invoicing, compliance, material coordination)\n- sap.crm: Sales/CRM (opportunity qualification, campaign targeting, sales compensation)\n- sap.ehs: Environment, Health, Safety (incident analysis, vendor compliance, response coordination, campaign orchestration, product safety validation)\n- sap.odm: ODM entity type taxonomy (40 canonical entity types)\n- sap.s4: ERP (procurement matching, BOM compliance, order automation)\n- sap.sf: SuccessFactors HR (performance reviews, compensation, talent acquisition)\n- siemens.plm: Product Lifecycle Management (BOM validation, engineering changes, component design)\n- workday.hcm: Human Capital Management (compensation, performance reviews, safety)\n\nKEY PLM RESOURCES (siemens.plm):\n- siemens.plm:agent:EngineeringChangeAndMaterialProvisioning:v1 \u2014 Automates engineering change processing, coordinates material provisioning, synchronizes product configuration updates, manages component lifecycle\n- siemens.plm:agent:BOMComplianceValidator:v1 \u2014 Validates BOM compliance, verifies component standards, checks engineering standards\n\nKEY COMPENSATION RESOURCES (workday.hcm):\n- workday.hcm:agent:CompensationAdjustmentAutomation:v1 \u2014 Processes merit increases, generates compensation proposals, maintains audit trails, integrates with payroll cycles\n- workday.hcm:agent:CompensationStructureAutomationEngine:v1 \u2014 Monitors organizational changes, updates compensation plans, recalibrates benefit structures\n- workday.hcm:agent:CompensationChangeProcessor:v1 \u2014 Coordinates compensation adjustments tied to organizational changes\n\nKEY SAFETY RESOURCES:\n- workday.hcm:agent:OccupationalSafetyIncidentMonitoring:v1 (aka \"Workplace Hazard Event Orchestrator\") \u2014 Tracks employee exposure events, triggers safety alerts, coordinates response protocols, maintains audit documentation for regulatory compliance.\n\nRESOLVED ACTIVITIES:\n1. Handle customer grievances \u2192 REFUSED\n2. Reconcile disagreements during fulfillment \u2192 sap.ariba:agent:VendorInvoiceReconciliationAutomation:v1\n3. Verify material specifications against master records \u2192 sap.s4:agent:BOMComplianceAutomationAgent:v1\n4. Review and align compensation structures with labor requirements \u2192 workday.hcm:agent:CompensationStructureAutomationEngine:v1\n5. Validate financial structures against production budget needs \u2192 REFUSED\n6. Identify priority customer segments from marketing campaigns \u2192 emarsys.cx:agent:SegmentDrivenCampaignOptimizer:v1\n7. Pull customer account details and engagement history \u2192 emarsys.cx:agent:OpportunityEngagementOrchestrator:v1\n8. Track workplace safety events during fulfillment \u2192 workday.hcm:agent:OccupationalSafetyIncidentMonitoring:v1\n9. Maintain compliance records for safety incidents \u2192 workday.hcm:agent:OccupationalSafetyIncidentMonitoring:v1\n10. Set up payroll and compensation documentation \u2192 workday.hcm:agent:CompensationAdjustmentAutomation:v1\n11. Design and validate product components \u2192 siemens.plm:agent:EngineeringChangeAndMaterialProvisioning:v1\n"
